    dcterms:title "Trafikförordning (1998:1276)" ;
    dcterms:creator "Sveriges regering" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/> ;
    rdfs:comment "A författning, which upphovsrättslagen (1960:729) 9 § första stycket leaves without copyright. Read from Riksdagen's open data, consolidated text as amended up to SFS 2026:1052; Källa: Sveriges riksdag. The consolidated text is not the authoritative one; the printed SFS is. Content taken: its rules, restated in the course's own Swedish words, each card citing its chapter and section."@en .

