                     "An additional panel is placed under two road signs placed directly above one another. Which sign does the panel belong to?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "Båda märkena"@sv ,
                    "Both signs"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "En tilläggstavla under två eller flera märken som sitter direkt över varandra avser alla märkena. Vägmärkesförordningen 2 kap. 2 § tredje stycket."@sv ,
                        "An additional panel under two or more signs placed directly above one another refers to all the signs. The Road Signs Ordinance, chapter 2, section 2, third paragraph."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-basics-6a-d1> ,
                          <#q-basics-6a-d2> ,
                          <#q-basics-6a-d3> .

