    solid-memo:distractorNote "Nej, märket gäller fordon i linjetrafik, inte hur många som åker i bilen."@sv ,
                              "No, the sign applies to vehicles in scheduled service, not to how many people are in the car."@en .

<#q-lanes-3b-d3>
