                        "The municipality may decide that the maximum permitted speed in a built-up area or part of it is 30 or 40 km/h. The Traffic Ordinance, chapter 3, section 17, second paragraph."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-speed-2c-d1> ,
                          <#q-speed-2c-d2> ,
