                        "The distance must also be adjusted so that other road users can pass more easily (the Traffic Ordinance, chapter 3, section 2)."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-distance-2b-d1> ,
                          <#q-distance-2b-d2> ,
                          <#q-distance-2b-d3> .

