    solid-memo:front "Vilken symbol ska ett odubbat vinterdäck till en personbil vara märkt med?"@sv ,
                     "Which symbol must a non-studded winter tire for a passenger car be marked with?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "En alptopp med en snöflinga"@sv ,
                    "A mountain peak with a snowflake"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "TSFS 2009:19 3 §. Symbolen kallas 3PMSF. Märkningen POR godtas också, och dubbade däck räknas som vinterdäck."@sv ,
                        "TSFS 2009:19, section 3. The symbol is called 3PMSF. The marking POR is also accepted, and studded tires count as winter tires."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-distance-4c-d1> ,
                          <#q-distance-4c-d2> .

