                              "Walk back to the side they came from"@en ;
    solid-memo:distractorNote "Regeln säger att den gående ska fortsätta till andra sidan."@sv ,
                              "The rule says that the pedestrian must continue to the other side."@en .

<#q-signals-4c-d2>
