    solid-memo:distractorNote "Mörker räcker inte; det krävs dimma, kraftig nederbörd eller lika dålig sikt (72 §)."@sv ,
                              "Darkness is not enough; it takes fog, heavy precipitation or equally poor visibility (section 72)."@en .

<#q-lights-2b-d2>
