                     "What must not show through damage in an ordinary car tire?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "Däckets armering"@sv ,
                    "The tire's reinforcement"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Ett däck får inte ha hål, skåra eller annan skada som blottlägger armeringen (TSFS 2009:19 6 §)."@sv ,
                        "A tire must not have a hole, cut or other damage that exposes the reinforcement (TSFS 2009:19, section 6)."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-vehicle-2c-d1> ,
                          <#q-vehicle-2c-d2> ,
                          <#q-vehicle-2c-d3> .

