                    "No, a belt is not required when reversing"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Bilbältet behöver inte användas när fordonet står stilla, vid backning eller inom parkeringsplats, bensinstation och liknande (trafikförordningen 4 kap. 10 d §)."@sv ,
                        "The seat belt does not need to be worn when the vehicle is standing still, when reversing, or within a parking lot, gas station and similar (the Traffic Ordinance, chapter 4, section 10 d)."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-vehicle-5a-d1> ,
