    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 5 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-19T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Din bil har krockkuddar och bra deformationszoner. Skyddar de dig vid en krock i hög fart?"@sv ,
                     "Your car has airbags and good crumple zones. Do they protect you in a crash at high speed?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "Nej, vid hög fart räcker inte ens bra skydd"@sv ,
                    "No, at high speed even good protection is not enough"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Skyddssystemen kan hindra krockar eller minska följderna, men vid hög fart kan inte ens en perfekt deformationszon hindra att de som sitter i bilen dödas (ERSO, Speed and speeding, avsnitt 1.5 och 1.6)."@sv ,
                        "Safety systems can prevent crashes or reduce their consequences, but at high speed not even a perfect crumple zone can prevent the people in the car from being killed (ERSO, Speed and speeding, sections 1.5 and 1.6)."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-vehicle-5c-d1> ,
