                    "Whoever owns the car"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Ägaren av ett motorfordon ska underhålla och sköta det så att utsläppskraven uppfylls. Avgasreningslagen (2011:318) 14 §."@sv ,
                        "The owner of a motor vehicle must maintain and look after it so that the emission requirements are met. The Emission Control Act (2011:318), section 14."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-environment-6a-d1> ,
