                        "In class 3, a passenger car may be driven only if it is an electric car, a fuel cell vehicle or a gas-powered car that meets Euro 6. There are exemptions, for example for emergency vehicles. The Traffic Ordinance, chapter 4, section 22 d and chapter 11, section 4."@en ;
